<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: loiter flight control -->
  <DMSE_Payload_Loiter.label>盤旋飛控</DMSE_Payload_Loiter.label>
  <!-- EN: Flight-control software and an extra fuel reserve for loitering munitions. When the seeker finds nothing on arrival, the drone does not fall back to inertial guidance: it holds over the target area for about an in-game hour, re-running its seeker every few seconds, and only dives on an inertial impact point once that time runs out.\n\nA loitering drone still sits in the interception wave: terminal defences can shoot it down the whole time it waits. Requires a loitering munition airframe. -->
  <DMSE_Payload_Loiter.description>巡飛彈專用的飛控軟體與額外燃料儲備。抵達目標時若導引頭找不到目標，無人機不會直接回退慣性導引，而是在目標上空盤旋約一個遊戲小時，每幾秒重新執行一次導引頭；盤旋時間用盡後才以慣性落點俯衝。\n\n盤旋中的無人機仍留在攔截波次裡：末端防禦在整段等待期間都能把它打下來。需要巡飛彈彈體。</DMSE_Payload_Loiter.description>
  <!-- EN: Loiter -->
  <DMSE_Payload_Loiter.designWord>盤旋</DMSE_Payload_Loiter.designWord>
  
  <!-- EN: inertial guidance -->
  <DMSE_Shahed_Guidance_Inertial.label>慣性制導</DMSE_Shahed_Guidance_Inertial.label>
  <!-- EN: Standard inertial guidance with no target recognition or terminal guidance. Uses one fire-control channel. Impacts scatter around the center of the target map. It does not lock onto buildings or creatures. -->
  <DMSE_Shahed_Guidance_Inertial.description>標準慣性導引，沒有目標辨識與末端導引。佔用一條火控通道。落點散布在目標地圖中央附近，不會鎖定建築或生物。</DMSE_Shahed_Guidance_Inertial.description>
  
  <!-- EN: radar-homing seeker -->
  <DMSE_Shahed_Guidance_RadarHoming.label>反輻射雷達導引頭</DMSE_Shahed_Guidance_RadarHoming.label>
  <!-- EN: A passive seeker that homes on radar emissions only. It locks onto the most powerful enemy radar that is switched on; if there is no radar to lock, it reports no target instead of falling back to a power grid. Combine it with a loiter flight control to keep the drone waiting overhead until a radar comes on. Passive acoustic mirrors are invisible to it. -->
  <DMSE_Shahed_Guidance_RadarHoming.description>被動尋標頭，只追蹤開機中的雷達。鎖定開機中功率最高的敵方雷達；沒有可鎖定的雷達時直接回報沒有目標，不會退化為打電網。搭配盤旋飛控可讓無人機在上空等待雷達開機。被動聲學反射器對它不可見。</DMSE_Shahed_Guidance_RadarHoming.description>
  <!-- EN: Radar -->
  <DMSE_Shahed_Guidance_RadarHoming.designWord>雷達</DMSE_Shahed_Guidance_RadarHoming.designWord>
  
  <!-- EN: TV guidance -->
  <DMSE_Shahed_Guidance_TV.label>電視制導</DMSE_Shahed_Guidance_TV.label>
  <!-- EN: An optional TV guidance module. When the drone reaches the target map, you choose the impact point. Uses two fire-control channels instead of one. Enemy drones with this module use inertial guidance instead. -->
  <DMSE_Shahed_Guidance_TV.description>可選的電視導引模組。無人機抵達目標地圖時，由你選擇落點。會佔用兩條火控通道而不是一條。敵方無人機即使裝了此模組，也只會使用慣性導引。</DMSE_Shahed_Guidance_TV.description>
  <!-- EN: TV -->
  <DMSE_Shahed_Guidance_TV.designWord>電視</DMSE_Shahed_Guidance_TV.designWord>
  
</LanguageData>